y benchmark summary. History pooling followed by static/history/task token interaction is an inherited structural reference, not new local proof. The prior local model already has this broad pattern; original HiFormer text is unavailable.\",\n      \"transformed_mechanism\": \"Retain inherited post-pooling unified interaction, but change only field-wise retrieval normalization to test intensity-carrying summary units. No hierarchical HiFormer block is copied or newly introduced.\",\n      \"variant_names\": [\n        \"mass_sum\",\n        \"mass_normalized\",\n        \"count_scaled\",\n        \"softmax_reference\"\n      ],\n      \"nearest_work_difference\": \"Our inherited per-field target/context queries, five global summaries, shared small blocks and direct summary/static skip differ from the inspected event pooling and heterogeneous HiFormer blocks. The magnitude motivation is known from DIN; novelty unverified.\",\n      \"falsifier\": \"A mass_sum failure against matched normalization/count controls gives no support for the proposed intensity change; no claim about original HiFormer effectiveness follows.\",\n      \"source_refs\": [\n        \"unirank-benchmark-v2\",\n        \"unirank-code:HiFormer\",\n        \"paper:hiformer\"\n      ],\n      \"executed_refs\": [\n        {\n          \"trial_id\": \"g0-r0001-mass_sum\",\n          \"source_sha256\": \"6fbfb02abebe055dc9a67a3e7623104ada87350c4c2e0dcc23ec63f2f091fd7a\",\n          \"status\": \"success\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"trial_id\": \"g0-r0001-mass_normalized\",\n          \"source_sha256\": \"ecb9698efa49ce67c7df576df98a4b77de5a87db6a6cba881ea3505cfeffd116\",\n          \"status\": \"success\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"trial_id\": \"g0-r0001-count_scaled\",\n          \"source_sha256\": \"7671d93e6656a1a6025b0e44a6fba533bab3094b30b136657a8a419753d2bff3\",\n          \"status\": \"success\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"trial_id\": \"g0-r0001-softmax_reference\",\n  